OL,3,APope says 'scourge' of abuse must be
OL,4,Arooted out as he visits Lourdes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo has called on French bishops
OL,7,Fto root out the "scourge" of sexual
OL,8,Fabuse in the Roman Catholic church,
OL,9,Furging them to "maintain the greatest
OL,10,Fvigilance".
OL,12,FThe Pope delivered the message to
OL,13,Fbishops during a private meeting at the
OL,14,FSanctuary of Our Holy Lady of Lourdes,
OL,15,Fa holy site in southern France, on the
OL,16,Fthird day of his four-day official
OL,17,Fvisit to France.
OL,19,FA 2021 inquiry found that clergy or lay
OL,20,Fmembers of the Church had abused about
OL,21,F330,000 people as children in France
OL,22,Fover 70 years.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
